Package: autoagent
Version: 0.8.1
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: AutoAgent Team <autoagent@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/autoagent/autoagent
Suggests: npm, nodejs
Description: AI-powered coding agent desktop application
 AutoAgent is an AI coding assistant with a native desktop GUI.
 It provides intelligent code generation, refactoring, debugging,
 and file manipulation through natural language interaction.
 .
 Powered by opencc engine with Anthropic Messages API support.
 .
 Features:
  - Native Electron desktop interface
  - Chat session management with branch/delete
  - Multi-tool orchestration (Bash, Read, Write, Glob, Grep, etc.)
  - MCP server support
  - Session persistence and resumption
  - Skill system (~/.claude/skills/ + project-level)
  - Provider configuration (Anthropic, OpenAI, DeepSeek, etc.)
